---
title: "claim_reward (Current Finance: Liquidity Mining)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_validate: validate_market(), ensure_version_matches()
    q_validate --> q_circuit: has_circuit_break_triggered()
    q_circuit --> q_error_cb: circuit_break == true
    q_circuit --> q_claim: circuit_break == false
    q_error_cb --> [*]: abort market_under_circuit_break
    q_claim --> q_get_miner: market.borrow_liquidity_mining_mut()
    q_get_miner --> q_claim_rewards: miner.claim_rewards(reward_type, obligation_id, clock, reward_index)
    q_claim_rewards --> q_emit: emit RewardClaimedEvent
    q_emit --> [*]: return reward Coin

    note right of q_claim_rewards
        INV-001: reward_type distinguishes deposit vs borrow rewards
        INV-002: reward_index specifies which reward pool to claim from
        INV-003: claimed rewards converted to Coin via into_coin
    end note
